; tracked now, so 12 is no longer all of them, and this constant says nothing about whether the
; 31 added since resolve. The deployed route was NOT re-probed for this edit -- doing so is a
; network measurement and none was taken -- so that question is unmeasured here rather than
; answered either way.
pub const RESOLVED_MODULE_COUNT : u8 = 12;
